  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/SegundoDiaFerieMedieval14Fanzara15.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px\" /></p>\n<p>Fanzara se ha sumergido este largo fin de semana de tres d&iacute;as&nbsp;en su III Feria Medieval, con algunas paradas y actividades paralelas, como la representaci&oacute;n del otorgamiento del acta de repoblaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/inaugferiamedieval14fanzara1.jpg\" alt=\"inaugferiamedieval14fanzara1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/inaugferiamedieval14fanzara2.jpg\" alt=\"inaugferiamedieval14fanzara2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/inaugferiamedieval14fanzara3.jpg\" alt=\"inaugferiamedieval14fanzara3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/inaugferiamedieval14fanzara4.jpg\" alt=\"inaugferiamedieval14fanzara4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/inaugferiamedieval14fanzara5.jpg\" alt=\"inaugferiamedieval14fanzara5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/segundodiaferiemedieval14fanzara1.jpg\" alt=\"segundodiaferiemedieval14fanzara1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/segundodiaferiemedieval14fanzara10.jpg\" alt=\"segundodiaferiemedieval14fanzara10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara14/se